 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGranite & Co Ltd                                              MASTER SERVICES\nUnit 7, Riverside Estate, LS1 4DY Leeds, United Kingdom       AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB612488652\n\nFROM                                                            BILL TO\n\nGranite & Co Ltd                                                Granite & Co Ltd\nUnit 7, Riverside Estate                                        Unit 7, Riverside Estate\nLS1 4DY Leeds                                                   M1 2AB Manchester\nUnited Kingdom                                                  United Kingdom\nVAT: GB612488652\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 20/03/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Granite & Co Ltd, with its registered office at Unit 7, Riverside Estate, Leeds\n(\"Party A\"), and Granite & Co Ltd, with its registered office at Unit 7, Riverside Estate, Manchester\n(\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Granite & Co Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B   Granite & Co Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate      20/03/2026",
